  <div class="wrap">
    <h4>Sources and references</h4><ul><li>Housing Industry Association: <a href="https://hia.com.au">hia.com.au</a></li><li>Master Builders Australia: <a href="https://www.masterbuilders.com.au">www.masterbuilders.com.au</a></li><li>ASIC Moneysmart: Renovating: <a href="https://moneysmart.gov.au">moneysmart.gov.au</a></li></ul><h4>About</h4><p>This is an independent editorial guide. Services and figures referenced from the <a href="https://www.bathrenovationmelbourne.com.au/">published service information</a>. This guide is editorial and is not the business itself.</p>
    <p>Independent editorial guide. Last updated: August 2026.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
